## Current Coverage And Reuse

- current_coverage: partially_done. Unified source preparation, typed dispatch, command contracts, decision material/receipts, supported early UR revision and structured closeout are present in retained current code. Retained tests do not fulfill the new TP. Bounded server generation control is not_done; actual new native/flow/review acceptance remains unqualified.
- reuse_strategy: extend existing launcher/server/session owners and preserve existing Core policy/writer/transaction owners. Reassess their contracts and actual operation evidence before adding code. No general orchestrator, global PID pool, second policy, duplicated store or alternate approval route.
- reference_regression_note: Current completed reference Runs evaluate blocked at OR under the new closeout readiness checks, rather than the old review's open OR. They are protected historical inputs; do not repair them or claim compatibility merely because new fixture flows pass. PRD/SD must distinguish historical insufficiency from current completion and specify supported diagnostics/transition.

